{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>第一季叫好叫座的TVB節目《超時空男臣》載譽歸來，續集《超時空男臣 II》預告片近日首度曝光，蕭正楠、曹永廉、何廣沛三位主角原班人馬回歸，竟以古裝造型現身人來人往的銅鑼灣，更上演一杯「廢水」三份飲的爆笑場面，惡搞經典畫面，究竟他們今次穿越所</p>\n<p>\n2017年曾經叫好叫座的TVB劇集《超時空男臣》載譽歸來，續集《超時空男臣 II》預告片在《TVB節目巡禮2027》首度曝光，蕭正楠、曹永廉、何廣沛三位主角原班人馬回歸，竟以古裝造型現身人來人往的銅鑼灣，更上演一杯「廢水」三份飲的爆笑場面，惡搞經典畫面，究竟他們今次穿越所為何事？\n</p>\n<h2>《超時空男臣 II》預告片曝光 蕭正楠曹永廉何廣沛銅鑼灣玩穿越</h2>\n<p>在《超時空男臣 II》的預告片中，蕭正楠、曹永廉、何廣沛三位「男臣」再次大玩穿越，直接以一身古裝扮相出現在現代的銅鑼灣鬧市，與周遭環境格格不入，畫面極具喜感。最搞笑的一幕，是三人竟模仿經典電影畫面，不過並非「三人食雪糕」，而是圍著一杯手搖飲品「廢水」三份飲，表情趣怪，噱頭十足，完美展現劇集的搞笑本色。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_17154059046b011a850da05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_17154059046b011a850da05.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_9291729196b011a89aeb11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_9291729196b011a89aeb11.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>新任務揭曉 三傻再臨現代尋找太子公主</h2>\n<p>為何三位男臣再次回到現代？據悉，今次他們肩負全新任務，就是要尋找失散的太子及公主。預告片中雖然未有透露太多線索，但這個全新的劇情主線已經成功勾起觀眾的好奇心，到底尋人過程會鬧出多少笑話，三位男臣又會如何應對現代生活的各種衝擊，實在令人期待。</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>網民期待爆燈：原班人馬終於返嚟！</h2>\n<p>續集預告一出，大批忠實觀眾及網民立即湧入討論區留言，表示期待已久。網民紛紛表示：「呢三兄弟返嚟一定笑死！」「原班人馬終於返嚟，回憶返哂嚟！」「飲廢水代替食雪糕，編劇太有才，笑到肚痛！」「好掛住佢哋啲膠gag，求快啲播！」「曹永廉個樣都係咁抵死！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_5081832026b011a7b8b0dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_5081832026b011a7b8b0dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14204678796b011a8072351.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14204678796b011a8072351.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_17982027536b011a8d7726d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_17982027536b011a8d7726d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_939146446b011a930080c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_939146446b011a930080c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p> \n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.080697+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1007,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:25.993400+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:25.993400+00:00","content_hash":"295697d6e68aed4c49c3c336a3917f1257c5b83dceed71f8b805579eef600ed9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}